# Pegue aqui un repositorio GitHub por linea. El workflow conservara los fallidos.
#
# Formatos admitidos:
# https://github.com/owner/repo
# https://github.com/owner/repo pkgname
# https://github.com/owner/repo pkgname binary ejecutable
# https://github.com/owner/repo pkgname bundle ejecutable
# https://github.com/owner/repo pkgname source cmake
# Agregue --ignore-license solo si GitHub no detecta la licencia y ya la reviso.
